<LANGUAGE>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_01_03_upsilon_outside">
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_001_ScavengeRobot_001">It&apos;s so empty.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_002_ScavengeRobot_001">Everyone&apos;s just gone.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_003_ScavengeRobot_001">How long has it been?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_004_ScavengeRobot_001">I feel so drained.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_005_ScavengeRobot_001">I just miss them so much.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_006_ScavengeRobot_001">How do hell do you get so thirsty?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_006_ScavengeRobot_002">Fucking parched.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_007_ScavengeRobot_001">Must be some around here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Idle_008_ScavengeRobot_001">I don&apos;t feel like myself anymore.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_001_ScavengeRobot_001">You have any to spare?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_002_ScavengeRobot_001">I need it, you know.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_003_ScavengeRobot_001">Just a little.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_004_ScavengeRobot_001">Come on, just to get by.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_005_ScavengeRobot_001">Don&apos;t be greedy.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_006_ScavengeRobot_001">You have plenty.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_007_ScavengeRobot_001">Don&apos;t be like that.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Stalk_008_ScavengeRobot_001">You know what it&apos;s like.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_001_ScavengeRobot_001">Why are you making me do this?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_002_ScavengeRobot_001">I don&apos;t want to do this, it&apos;s your fault!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_003_ScavengeRobot_001">Learn to share, for fucks sake!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_004_ScavengeRobot_001">Give it here, give it to me!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_005_ScavengeRobot_001">Stop resisting. You know I&apos;m right!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Tempted_006_ScavengeRobot_001">Why are you doing this?!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkFirstStart_001_ScavengeRobot_001">You&apos;re real. Please, give me some for the pain.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkStart_001_ScavengeRobot_001">You changed your mind.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkStart_002_ScavengeRobot_001">So good to see you.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkStart_003_ScavengeRobot_001">Thought you left me for dead.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkStart_004_ScavengeRobot_001">Couldn&apos;t keep away, could you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkStart_005_ScavengeRobot_001">We have to stop meeting like this.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkEnd_001_ScavengeRobot_001">Don&apos;t leave. Help me!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkEnd_002_ScavengeRobot_001">He had it inside him. I could feel it.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkEnd_003_ScavengeRobot_001">Hey, wait up! Come back.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_StalkEnd_004_ScavengeRobot_001">He&apos;ll come back, right? Right.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Alert_001_ScavengeRobot_001">Why are you hiding?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Alert_002_ScavengeRobot_001">Come out, I won&apos;t hurt you.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Alert_003_ScavengeRobot_001">I hear you, sneaking around.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_Alert_004_ScavengeRobot_001">I know you&apos;re there. I can hear you.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_AlertBeforeSeen_001_ScavengeRobot_001">Huh? Who is that?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_AlertBeforeSeen_002_ScavengeRobot_001">Who&apos;s there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_AlertBeforeSeen_003_ScavengeRobot_001">What was that?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_AlertBeforeSeen_004_ScavengeRobot_001">Anyone there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RobotTalk_Scavenge_AlertBeforeSeen_005_ScavengeRobot_001">Hello?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_intro_breath_001_player_001">What... what the hell? How is this possible?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_001_Echo_Amy_001">Come in Theta? You better answer me, Strasky. Come on.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_002_Echo_Peter_001">Amy, where are you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_003_Echo_Amy_001">The fields - I had to leave.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_004_Echo_Peter_001">Is Carl with you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_005_Echo_Amy_001">It all went to hell.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_006_Echo_Peter_001">Hold on. You got the power automated, right? The plant is safe? We need power to keep the sites runn...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_007_Echo_Amy_001">Fuck the power! Fuck you, Strasky! The machines killed Carl!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_008_Echo_Peter_001">All right. Calm down. It&apos;ll be okay. Can you get back to Theta?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_009_Echo_Amy_001">Yeah, I think so. I&apos;ll head for the shuttle, the aux.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Echo_Datamine_AmyTheta_010_Echo_Peter_001">Good luck, Amy. Rooting for you.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_leftcommroom_001_player_001">This isn&apos;t... this is insane... </Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_leftcommroom_002_player_001">... Aaaahhhhhh!!! Aaahhhhh!!!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_leftcommroom_objective_001_player_001">Lambda, find a shuttle to Lambda.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="simoncomments_thankkatebot_001_player_001">Thanks, little guy.</Entry>
    </CATEGORY>
</LANGUAGE>
